Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}＜游马：决斗嘉年华 决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在球形场地战斗的我和特隆的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.67,0:00:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方各自召唤出3只 No.怪兽，胜负现在才要开始！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.91,0:00:11.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不能输！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}燃起来吧！我！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(特隆)没想到你也是居然召唤出了3只……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来你只有运气不错呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才不是什么运气！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我的实力！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光体)这个布阵的话能赢！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.02,0:00:31.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一扫而空吧！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:35.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇龙 效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用1个超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～复仇龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击白辉士 启明者！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.71,0:00:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复仇之流！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.73,0:01:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再来一击！上吧～希望皇 霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击基因人·赫利塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.78,0:01:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.09,0:01:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 也没什么大不了的这种程度而已。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的场地上还有
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:28.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000的酸液石人。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.18,0:01:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量三角之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.76,0:01:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有3只以上超量怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:44.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.50,0:01:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去吧！破坏酸液石人！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:01:59.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连这种卡都准备好了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！这样一来 你的 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.20,0:02:03.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就全都被我打倒了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(等{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}々{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力)这 难道说难道说真的有可能！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.79,0:02:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(铁男)特隆的手牌和盖卡都是零。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在下一回合那家伙的回合要是叫不出怪兽的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.06,0:02:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(德之助)游马赢了耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.05,0:02:16.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凯西)加油啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:22.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就这样 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵… 怎么感觉 难道说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你真的以为能赢过我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我为了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe} 也为了快斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对要 赢你！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.55,0:02:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的场上有３只 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.20,0:02:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 让我拿出真本事的舞台已经准备好了呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.28,0:02:45.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:48.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我的 命运抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.21,0:02:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开玩笑的。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把送去墓地的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动纹章兽 独角兽的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这只怪兽从墓地除外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使墓地里的1只
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.74,0:03:07.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.09,0:03:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.97,0:03:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤！现身吧！白辉士 启明者！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着，发动墓地里的另一只
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.37,0:03:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽 独角兽的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同样地，将墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基因人 继承者特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算召唤出那种怪兽，也是没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.24,0:03:31.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的怪兽攻击力更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。他的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并不是让复活的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.06,0:03:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果目的是攻击的话，攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.02,0:03:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把攻击力最高的酸液魔像
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先复活才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动魔法卡 重生·梅达利翁！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让自己墓地里的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.87,0:03:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级4以下的纹章兽复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.82,0:03:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}苏醒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纹章兽 伯纳斯猎鹰！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动伯纳斯猎鹰的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在场上出现时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以将自己场上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部变成相同等级。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.35,0:04:27.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽阶级变成等级！？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 那家伙的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就有3只等级4的怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:32.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道说……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.74,0:04:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 照明者 和 基因人·继承者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及 伯纳斯猎鹰进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:47.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用3只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:49.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.59,0:04:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，No.69。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.29,0:05:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下，我真正的王牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之奖章 纹章之盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.30,0:05:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于来了吗，那个 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.38,0:05:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新银河眼时空龙的 No.！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.49,0:05:25.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个 No.这家伙正是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.72,0:05:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托隆复仇心的化身。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呼……好痛苦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}憎恨满溢，令人窒息。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不需要什么面具了……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}反正你们这场决斗就是最后了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.79,0:05:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结束后就把记忆……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不，是一切都会被夺走呢……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特别让你见识一下吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的真面目！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Mr.心园)这 这是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(Dr.费卡)拜隆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}脸 脸变得…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.85,0:08:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错…在异世界之间的狭缝中徘徊的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:13.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我就变成了这副模样。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的身体里剩下的只有复仇之心了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆 也就是说它的真身{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.76,0:08:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不再是这个世界的人类了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害啊 那个AR。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连角色都会变。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.59,0:08:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不愧是 决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不对 才不是什么AR！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.44,0:08:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底 那才是真正的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.45,0:08:45.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 快逃…。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.01,0:08:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家 振作一点啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不去给游马加油还有谁会去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 星光体看好了 我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是 我得到的究极的 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙有着特殊的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.81,0:09:09.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}武装徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被卡的效果破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.55,0:09:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这家伙以外场上存在的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有效果无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:18.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并能将那些效果归为己用。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:22.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其他怪兽的效果归为己用！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.54,0:09:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错不管拥有什么样的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在武装徽章面前都无能为力！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下 所谓的友情
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.75,0:09:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望什么的根本不存在！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 手臂之衣 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之勋章·手！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.31,0:10:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果被 夺走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:04.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我马上 就用给你看。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 手臂之衣 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将1个 超量单元 使用
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺来的 复仇龙 的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.05,0:10:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是将 手臂之衣 的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}提升500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 我发动墓地中的 纹章兽雷欧 的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己怪兽的攻击力发生变化时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将这张卡除外按其变化的攻击力数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降低对方怪兽的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 复仇龙 的攻击力！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把复仇龙给葬送掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:43.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接招！神之怒！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.98,0:11:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有如此惊人的 No.之力……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思，贝隆。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的复仇心就只有这种程度吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没事吧？游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.93,0:11:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，还差得远呢……！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.89,0:11:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还差得远？呵嘿嘿……你也差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该放弃了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和没用的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}、{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不同我可是无敌的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，这件大衣之臂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有着亲与子之间的力量差距。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}亲与子吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实，那只怪兽跟你简直一模一样！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在，我总算明白了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好 {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也好{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都是了不起的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.63,0:11:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都很出色！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.16,0:11:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼命地想要支撑住自己！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.66,0:11:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到最后 大家都在担心着你！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:11:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么那么好的家伙们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了你这种家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切都抛弃了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你觉得因为他们是亲子所以这是理所当然的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但不是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:13.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家都相信着！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相信你总有一天会变回原来的样子！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.31,0:12:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么你回来的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对那些家伙为什么你回来的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要去干复仇那种无聊的事{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么要开始做那种事啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.40,0:12:31.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你不可能懂的。像你这种小孩子……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.33,0:12:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:35.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会有多寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.24,0:12:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙大家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为你不在了都很寂寞啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不安得想哭拼了命地努力啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:50.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轮不到你来说这种话……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:55.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:57.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.67,0:12:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}……
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}家人… 回忆…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种东西… 那种东西就随着这张脸一起…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.26,0:13:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会放弃 这场决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.78,0:13:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从大家那里承接过各种各样的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在那些东西传达给你之前我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.41,0:13:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，无所谓。马上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.67,0:13:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你成为纹章兽的饵食。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 到此回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是异晶界。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.18,0:13:38.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要赢那家伙 只能靠异晶界的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拟似空间{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}｡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个球形场地\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是仿造异世界建造的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拟似空间。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和皇之键里面一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里的话 就能成为ZEXAL。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.32,0:13:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过这场决斗 有很多人在看。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.70,0:13:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种事 怎样都无所谓！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.55,0:13:58.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能把大家的意念传递给他。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.89,0:14:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走吧 游马。 和我一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.85,0:14:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:11.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.07,0:14:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当遥远的两个灵魂交汇之时传承之力将会显现！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.86,0:14:44.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/星光体)ZEXAL！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.91,0:14:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Z、ZEXAL…？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊！ 那个。变身了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是游马和星光体的羁绊之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明大家都在看着 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到底…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:16.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事呢…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大 大家… 大家应该都会觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是AR吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 现在的游马超级帅的啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就像真正的英雄一样呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的 真的！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:28.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:33.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对啊！ 那才是真正的英雄啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 喂 德之助 别说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.50,0:15:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是ZEXAL啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护心园市的我们的英雄！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}其名为… ZEXAL～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.01,0:15:46.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}ZEXAL？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.10,0:15:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}ZEXAL？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！ 原来叫ZEXAL啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我喜欢！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.39,0:15:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不…那个 乌拉是…那个…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:16:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎…怎么感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好像造成了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无法挽回的误会… 乌拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.62,0:16:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.24,0:16:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 这样也不错吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害… 这么多人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.57,0:16:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都在为游马和阿斯特拉尔加油。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！泽阿尔乌拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到居然藏着合体这种隐藏招数呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.64,0:16:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别在意小事。集中精力决斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 哦哦… 我知道啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！混沌超量变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！我把希望皇霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.53,0:17:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材进行混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.41,0:17:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普雷出场了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是没用的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.15,0:17:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动宫廷礼服的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之圣杯手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普雷 你的怪兽效果我收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}休想！发动魔法卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:43.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七之宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.55,0:17:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}七之宝藏可以通过将自己场上的1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.41,0:17:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.89,0:17:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.94,0:17:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择特拉比特！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 那只被解放的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有超量单位的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:18:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以按照那个数量抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.87,0:18:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特拉比特拥有的超量单位是2个。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.39,0:18:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我能抽的卡合计3张！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.33,0:18:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽卡也是决斗者创造的！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:15.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马/星光体)所有的光芒啊，力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我的右腕照亮希望之路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.89,0:18:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.05,0:18:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了，异热同心武器！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.15,0:18:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}铠甲外套可以无效并吸收
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对手的怪兽效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，被装备的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:39.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心武器的效果却无法被夺走。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此。是这么来的啊……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:46.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心武器 闪电之剑装备！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个异热同心武器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不召唤到场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.01,0:18:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接装备到霍普身上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升1200点！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，当这张卡被装备的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的魔法 陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}武装徽章所
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从 No.系那里夺来的力量，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可没有能躲开这招的能力！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 闪电光刃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收下啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.55,0:19:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我等的就是这次攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.05,0:19:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动武装徽章的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:36.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是在对手发动攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个超量素材，
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏场上的1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我选择希望皇霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:46.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:48.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让你见识一下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.59,0:19:53.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神原本的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.23,0:19:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧，武装徽章！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神之粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动闪电剑的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.67,0:20:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备怪兽被效果破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.17,0:20:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将泽阿尔武器返回手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效那次破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.92,0:20:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 又耍这种小把戏……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 战斗还在继续哦……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.49,0:20:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管怎样 霍普雷都完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}干掉它！ 光子臂膀！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把霍普雷捏碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:39.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从墓地发动骷髅人的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.12,0:20:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.14,0:20:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的怪兽被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.97,0:20:45.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过除外墓地里的骷髅人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:49.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效那次破坏并将伤害变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（骷髅人）骷髅人～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:21:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}救……救命～……救命稻草～！骨头～。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.15,0:21:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了 救命稻草人！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.37,0:21:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢耍这种花招！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.81,0:21:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然把那种怪兽埋进墓地里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！ 再次装备闪电之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:48.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真顽强啊。不愧是一马的儿子。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}偏偏在无聊的地方一模一样。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特隆！ 在这场决斗中我一定要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.33,0:21:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把大家的心意传达给你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.61,0:23:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.64,0:23:46.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.19,0:23:50.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.25,0:23:54.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.20,0:23:58.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.31,0:24:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.51,0:24:07.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.79,0:24:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.51,0:24:13.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们好不容易帅气地变身了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.33,0:24:15.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔乌拉是什么啊 德之助那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.77,0:24:17.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爱与正义的战士 泽阿尔乌拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.59,0:24:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}勇气与胜利的战士 泽阿尔乌拉… 呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:24.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说你啊不是挺中意的嘛！

